tacado de la propiedad es la terraza privada en la azotea, que cuenta con una piscina privada, zonas para tomar el sol y un amplio espacio para comer al aire libre, ideal para relajarse o recibir invitados mientras se disfrutan las vistas panorámicas del Mediterráneo y del golf.\n\nEntre sus características prácticas, incluye dos plazas de garaje privadas y un trastero, ofreciendo comodidad y seguridad. Situado cerca ‌de ‌campos ‌de ‌golf, ‌tiendas, ‌restaurantes, playas ‌y Puerto ‌Banús, este ático representa una ‌oportunidad ‌lista ‌para ‌entrar ‌a vivir en una ‌de ‌las ‌comunidades ‌más ‌codiciadas ‌de ‌Marbella.","en":"This completely renovated penthouse in the prestigious Magna Marbella community offers a rare combination of modern elegance, comfort, and breathtaking scenery. Set within a secure gated enclave with 24-hour security, the property enjoys panoramic views of the mountains, sea, and surrounding golf course, creating an exceptional backdrop for daily living.\n\nInside, double-height ceilings and a bright open-plan layout seamlessly connect the living, dining, and kitchen areas. Every detail has been carefully updated, from the sleek finishes to the underfloor-heated bathrooms, ensuring both comfort and contemporary style. Sold fully furnished, the home is ready to move into and enjoy immediately.\n\nThe highlight of the property is the private rooftop terrace, which features a private pool, sunbathing areas, and generous space for outdoor dining—perfect for relaxing or entertaining while taking in the sweeping Mediterranean and golf views.\n\nPractical features include two private garage spaces and a storage room, adding convenience and security. Ideally located ‌close ‌to ‌golf ‌courses, ‌shops, ‌restaurants, beaches, ‌and Puerto ‌Banús, this penthouse is a ‌turnkey ‌opportunity ‌to ‌own ‌a stylish, well-connected home ‌in ‌one ‌of ‌Marbella’s ‌most ‌sought-after ‌communities."},"features":{"es":["Primera línea de Golf","Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca de Colegios","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Nueva Construcción","Privada","Aire Acondicionado","Chimenea","Baño","Mar","Montaña","Golf","Panorámicas","Terraza Privada","Solario","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Amueblada","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Portero Automático","Seguridad 24 Horas","Más de uno","Comunitario","Golf"],"en":["Frontline Golf","Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Schools","Excellent","Recently Renovated","New Construction","Private","Air Conditioning","Fireplace","U/F/H Bathrooms","Sea","Mountain","Golf","Panoramic","Private Terrace","Solarium","Barbeque","Double Glazing","Fully Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Gated Complex","Entry Phone","24 Hour Security","More Than One","Communal","Golf"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"4,800","ibi":"0","basura":"0"}}